## C++ Dependencies

The C++ SDK itself has no external C++ runtime dependencies. It links the prebuilt Zerobus FFI library (`rust/ffi/`) through its C header and depends only on the C++ standard library.

For a complete list of Rust dependencies and their licenses, see the `../rust/sdk/Cargo.toml` and `../rust/ffi/Cargo.toml` files.
